WEBVTT

00:14:58.734 --> 00:15:00.797
But that's OK,

00:15:00.821 --> 00:15:03.838
because we have so much imagination --

00:15:03.862 --> 00:15:05.309
if we use it.

00:15:05.333 --> 00:15:10.810
We have deep talents
of inventiveness and exploration --

00:15:10.834 --> 00:15:12.611
if we apply them.

00:15:12.635 --> 00:15:18.152
We are brave enough to invent things
we've never seen before.

00:15:19.175 --> 00:15:20.790
Lose those skills,

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.532
and we are adrift.

00:15:24.384 --> 00:15:27.109
But hone and develop them,

00:15:28.498 --> 00:15:30.956
we can make any future we choose.